# Keep only the three compact, canonical benchmark tables in Git.
data/final/*
!data/final/experimental_kcat_truth.csv
!data/final/benchmark_ready_truth.csv
!data/final/benchmark_ready_catpred.csv

# Third-party repositories and weights are restored from their upstream
# sources and Zenodo. Keep only the public source/version manifest in Git.
external_methods/*
!external_methods/METHOD_SOURCES.md

